Dear families, welcome! We can't wait to meet you. Come see our classrooms, meet our teachers and ask anything you like. Here is everything you need for the evening.

## When and where

kpi Date | Thu 2026-11-12 | open house
kpi Time | 17:30 to 19:30 | two hours
kpi Place | 410 Elm Street | main building

## Schedule

