## What to bring

Planning to register your child for kindergarten in 2027-28? Please bring:

- [ ] Birth certificate
- [ ] Proof of address
- [ ] Immunization records

! Kindergarten registration opens on 2027-01-12.

## Getting here

- **Parking:** free in the Elm Street lot, with 60 spaces.
- **Shuttle:** a free shuttle runs every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot.
- **Childcare:** we will look after siblings in the music room.

## Questions

We are happy to help. Call us at 555-0166 or write to [office@cedarwood.example](mailto:office@cedarwood.example).

See you soon!
Warmly, Dr. Leonie Osei, Principal
